# VPR-only flow: pack, place and route, then stop.
# Architecture studies only need VPR's timing and wirelength, so this skips fabric
# building, fabric Verilog, repacking and bitstream generation, which took ~75% of
# each run (eltwise: 426 s OpenFPGA total, 44 s of it VPR).
# Selected with `advanced.vpr_only: true` in the setup YAML.

vpr ${VPR_ARCH_FILE} ${VPR_TESTBENCH_BLIF}

exit
